prompts.hair:
Use case: stylized-concept. A TRANSPARENT 4-column 2-row sprite atlas containing SEVEN hair overlays plus one baseball cap overlay, original adult male fine pixel art for a baseball game character portrait. Match the adult head silhouette in reference1 and the detailed pixel aesthetic in reference2. Do NOT depict skin, heads, facial features, necks, mannequins or backgrounds. Only isolated hair shapes and one cap. Every cell front view, centered and same head size, ample transparent gutter. A face-shaped opening through each hair piece must be fully transparent. Think a wig PNG that fits over the provided head. Dark brown hair with 3-4 crisp warm highlight tones, clear angular strands made of square pixel clusters. No gradients, no glows, no soft shadows.
Left to right top row:
1 very short tidy crop, short simple fringe, trimmed sideburns;
2 short side-parted hair with modest swept fringe;
3 medium layered hair reaching ears, center-part opening;
4 medium hair with neck-length side sections, face fully exposed.
Bottom row:
5 longer straight hair tucked behind ears, short side-parted forehead strands;
6 wavy medium-long hair with big controlled pixel locks and face opening;
7 hair swept back into low ponytail, restrained front sweep, tie visible on one side but front view;
8 plain deep teal baseball cap, white tiny side highlight but NO emblem or text, front view, curved visor. Cap is isolated open-bottom overlay, no head or hair inside.
Keep hair crown consistent with natural adult head proportions, not giant anime hair. Transparent space for eyes in all7styles. Every item fits fully in its cell and does not touch neighbors. Actual alpha transparency, not painted checkerboard. No labels/numbers/logos/frames/lines.
